(80, 1, '2025-01-10 08:37:54', '2025-01-10 08:37:54', '<img src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n										123-456-7890\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<h1>This Headline Grabs Visitors’ Attention</h1>				\n		<p>A short description introducing visitors to your business and the services you offer</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Contact us\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"833\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder_Hero-1024x833.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder_Hero-1024x833.jpeg 1024w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder_Hero-300x244.jpeg 300w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder_Hero-768x624.jpeg 768w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder_Hero.jpeg 1027w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />															\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" />															\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" />															\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" />															\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" />															\n					<h3>About Us</h3>				\n		<p>Use this section to describe your company and the services you offer. You could share your company’s story and details about why you are in business. The goal is to create a connection with the visitor and give them confidence to work with you.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n					<h3>Our Services</h3>				\n					<p>This text briefly introduces visitors to your main services.</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Service 1</a></h4><p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Service 2</a></h4><p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Service 3</a></h4><p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Service 4</a></h4><p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>				\n					<h3>Why Choose Us</h3>				\n									<h4>\n							benefit 1						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 2						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 3						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 4						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n					<h3>Client Testimonials</h3>				\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n					<h3>A Title to Turn the Visitor Into a Lead</h3>				\n		Use this short paragraph to explain how you will deliver this benefit to the visitor if they decide to work with you.		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n										123-456-7890\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Mon-Fri 9:00AM - 5:00PM\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n											</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Twitter\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c13.969 7.797 30.214 12.67 47.431 13.319-28.264-18.843-46.781-51.005-46.781-87.391 0-19.492 5.197-37.36 14.294-52.954 51.655 63.675 129.3 105.258 216.365 109.807-1.624-7.797-2.599-15.918-2.599-24.04 0-57.828 46.782-104.934 104.934-104.934 30.213 0 57.502 12.67 76.67 33.137 23.715-4.548 46.456-13.32 66.599-25.34-7.798 24.366-24.366 44.833-46.132 57.827 21.117-2.273 41.584-8.122 60.426-16.243-14.292 20.791-32.161 39.308-52.628 54.253z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<p>© All Rights Reserved.</p>', 'Trang chủ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-01-10 08:37:54', '2025-01-10 08:37:54', '', 18, 'http://localhost/first-project/?p=80', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
