(2466, 1, '2022-02-01 07:34:10', '2022-02-01 07:34:10', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LMS websites have become the most convenient and popular solution for students recently, especially during the COVID-19 time. That’s why many people look for the top WordPress education themes to create an online learning website like Udemy or Coursera. And of course, they will notify about <strong><a href=\"https://thimpress.com/wordpress-education-themes-powered-by-learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://thimpress.com/wordpress-education-themes-powered-by-learnpress/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">LearnPress </a></strong>- the top 1 LMS plugin with a hundred thousand downloads on WordPress.org that is included in the theme features.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So don’t look anywhere else. We have done everything for you. Below is the list of high-quality education themes powered by LearnPress that are worth choosing to take your business to the next level. Hence, you can create, sell, and even manage online courses with ease or <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/beginner-guide-learnpress-payment-gateway-settings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">set up payment gateways</a> you want quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, you can find more information about this LMS plugin via<a href=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress-review-in-2022-features-benefits-pricing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress-review-features-benefits-pricing/\">LearnPress Review: Features, Benefits, Pricing</a></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s get started!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-8-best-learnpress-wordpress-themes-2022\"><strong>8+ Best LearnPress WordPress Themes</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-eduma-learnpress\"><strong>Eduma - LearnPress</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":733998,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Eduma-Education-WordPress-Theme-school-girls-default.jpg\" alt=\"eduma education wordpress theme learnpress\" class=\"wp-image-733998\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/G5Ook\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/education-wordpress-theme-education-wp/full_screen_preview/14058034\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/G5Ook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Eduma</strong></a> is our first suggestion compared to other education themes for WordPress. There is even a <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/review-eduma-education-wordpress-theme/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://thimpress.com/review-eduma-education-wordpress-theme/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Review Eduma</a> article for you to read more. Eduma is suitable for online education websites, coaching websites, training center websites, teaching websites, and LMS websites. In addition, Eduma integrates very well with <strong>LearnPress </strong>since they were developed by our <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ThimPress </a>team. You will never meet any issues when creating your courses. Also, the theme works perfectly with the Elementor builder to design your layouts quickly using the drag-n-drop method. No code is needed at all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What’s more? Different payment gateways available in this theme to help you sell your courses effectively are PayPal, Stripe, Authorize.net, 2Checkout, and Offline payment. Another fancy feature of Eduma is Events plugin compatibility. It allows you to manage expired events, ongoing events, and upcoming events so your students will not miss any events. Moreover, this plugin offers to sell event tickets using the built-in online ticket booking form as well. Lastly, Eduma is SEO &amp; speed optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Responsive design</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Course review/ rating</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Course collection</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Powerful LMS courses management</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Quiz management with many question types</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- WooCommerce, MailChimp, bbPress, Buddy Press, Paid Memberships Pro, Contact Form 7 ready</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Manage the commission rate per course</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- WPML &amp; RTL support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 1-click demo installation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Countless color schemes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-coaching-learnpress\"><strong>Coaching - Learnpress</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831148,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/coaching-learnpress.jpg\" alt=\"coaching learnpress\" class=\"wp-image-831148\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/Xq2Ra\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/speaker-and-life-coach-wordpress-theme-coaching-wp/full_screen_preview/17097658\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are a public speaker, a fitness trainer, a health coach, a physical therapist, and more, <a href=\"https://1.envato.market/Xq2Ra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Coaching</strong></a> is the right WordPress theme you need to go with. There are 9 elegant coaching demos for you to choose from, including the newest coaching business demo. Simply get the one you like and install it with a click. Coaching is also a 100% responsive theme, promising to adapt to any device and browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, Coaching is compatible with <strong>LearnPress </strong>so you can enjoy full LMS functionality like communicating with students/ instructors using the WordPress <strong>forum </strong>or creating courses using the drag-n-drop method. For the coaching website, of course, portfolios are the important factor you need to focus on since people always want to see it at first sight. But developers took care of it for you to make Coaching looks impressive and appealing as possible they can. Surely, you’ll have a professional and trustworthy website with <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/coaching-wordpress-theme/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Coaching WordPress Theme Review</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Revolution Slider support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Amazing parallax</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Elementor integration</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Unlimited colors &amp; skins</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- SEO-friendly</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 600+ Google Fonts</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- WooCommerce compatibility</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- RTL support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Smart event management system</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Timeline to display and scrolling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Excellent support team</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Author ratings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Detailed documentation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-corptrain-learnpress\"><strong>CorpTrain - LearnPress</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831149,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/corptrain-learnpress.jpg\" alt=\"corptrain learnpress\" class=\"wp-image-831149\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/13Zkd\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/course-builder-wordpress-learning-management-system-theme-elearning-software/full_screen_preview/20370918\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/13Zkd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>CorpTrain</strong></a> is a flexible and magical LMS WordPress theme for training and corporate to create training sites for employees. Thanks to <strong>LearnPress</strong>, the most important plugin helps CorpTrain stand out from the competition. You can make online courses and share them with your staff quickly even if you have no code experience. Apart from that, you can embed YouTube or Vimeo platforms if needed too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, you’ll find 9 prebuilt demos available to test and install with a click. If students like your course, they can purchase it easily with different payment methods available like PayPal, Stripe, etc. You can also translate CorpTrain into most languages, as it is WPML and RTL-ready. Let’s share your knowledge globally.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other languages:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Easy to use</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- High performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- WooCommerce ready</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Visual Composer support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Paid Memberships Pro</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Trainee certificate</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Co-trainers</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Course review/ rating</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-ivyprep\"><strong>IvyPrep</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831151,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/ivyprep.jpg\" alt=\"ivyprep\" class=\"wp-image-831151\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/akrzZ\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/ivy-school-education-university-wordpress-theme/full_screen_preview/22773871\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No list of the best WordPress themes for the education field could be complete without <a href=\"https://1.envato.market/akrzZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>IvyPrep</strong></a> playing a prominent role. It includes everything you need to create an LMS website with different homepage demos. Besides, there are 14 premade pages for each demo when needed. Moreover, IvyPrep works well with famous plugins like Slider Revolution for creating stunning sliders and WooCommerce for selling your school things.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What’s more? Our developers optimized IvyPrep to work seamlessly with <strong>LearnPress and Elementor </strong>so you can build online courses easily without touching any code. Apart from that, you can get the premium addons from this amazing LMS plugin in the <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/learnpress-pro/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>LearnPress Pro Bundle</strong></a> to make a flexible system like content drip, certificate, commission, multiple payment options, etc. Together with that, IvyPrep is SEO &amp; speed optimization. Lastly, you read our well-written documentation or contact our dedicated support for help and assistance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 1-click demo import</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Parallax effect</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Event management</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Google Fonts support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 1200+ icons</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Unlimited color options</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- UI/ UX optimization</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Translation-ready</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Lifetime update</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-epsilon\"><strong>Epsilon</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831152,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/epsilon.jpg\" alt=\"epsilon\" class=\"wp-image-831152\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/zknvM\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/lms-wordpress-theme-elearning-wp/full_screen_preview/11797847\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/zknvM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Epsilon</strong></a> is an eLearning LMS WordPress theme, designed for any type of education website. In particular, Epsilon is compatible with <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>LearnPress - #1 LMS plugin</strong></a> which offers numerous free and premium add-ons so you’ll have all the amazing features from this plugin. You can create and sell any course, add instructors, enable content drip, manage course progress, multiple quiz &amp; question types, different payment options, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What’s more? WooCommerce is available to add more ways for students to buy your courses. You can watch the video tutorial or access documentation to make online courses easily. Epsilon also packs an amazing page builder, giving you many customization options. Demos are ready to test and install in a few mins. Together with that is a lot of premade page templates for your school like about us, blog layout, gallery, become an instructor, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Responsive design</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Unlimited sidebars, layouts, templates, footer, and colors</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Beautiful mega menu</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Parallax effect</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- MailChimp integration</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- SEO-optimized</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- bbPress compatible</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- WPML &amp; RTL support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Student &amp; instructor profile</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-starkid\"><strong>StarKid</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831153,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/starkid.jpg\" alt=\"starkid\" class=\"wp-image-831153\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/oWov9\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/starkid-kindergarten-wordpress-theme/full_screen_preview/23451388\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As its name implies, <a href=\"https://1.envato.market/oWov9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>StarKid</strong></a> is a kindergarten, child care, preschool, and primary school WordPress theme. It gives you several high-quality demos to choose from and install with a click. Together with that, the theme offers tons of extensions and compatibility to make a feature-rich website. In addition, StarKid integrates well with LearnPress and Elementor, promising anyone can design the layout with ease.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>StarKid is entirely translatable so you can localize it easily, thanks to WPML &amp; RTL support. Course creation and event management are also included in the theme package. WooCommerce is available to create an eCommerce store professionally. Moreover, StarKid is easy to use and has fast responses for any screen size. The theme works well with Slider Revolution as well to make appealing pages and sliders. It also provides flexible payment options for students.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 20+ useful pages</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- SEO optimization</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 600+ Google Fonts</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Unlimited color options</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 1200+ icons with medical icons</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Excellent support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Regular updates</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-buddyx-learning-community-theme\">BuddyX Learning Community Theme</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":838643,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/buddyx.jpg\" alt=\"buddyx\" class=\"wp-image-838643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddyx-pro-theme/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://lms-demos.buddyxtheme.com/pro-learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddyx-pro-theme/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BuddyX</a> </strong>BuddyPress theme has a very structured layout that is easily understandable by learners. Whether you are creating this website for school, office training, or other trainings you can easily manage your website with buddyX. This theme has dedicated support to learndash and learnpress wordpress LMS plugins and it also supports Elementor and gutenberg website builders. It is also compatible with bbpress so you can make bulletin boards and discussion forums. save your time and effort from coding, create your website and have full control on it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sell your courses effortlessly as you want, you have many options as WooCommerce products, Subscriptions, course bundles, and more. You can add your course material in any form like audio, pdf and image, etc. It supports multiple payment gateway. Secure your website with registration and login. Engage your user with ultra-modern quizzing, assignment, course point, and other features like groups notification and much more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Compatible with WooCommerce</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEO-friendly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Detailed Documentation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High performance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multilingual</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>BuddyPress Support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multi Vendor plugins support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Elementor Pagebuilder support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Event Support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-edumodo\"><strong>Edumodo</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831154,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/edumodo.jpg\" alt=\"edumodo\" class=\"wp-image-831154\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/a1DA2Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"http://preview.themeforest.net/item/edumodo-allinone-lms-education-theme-for-wordpress/full_screen_preview/20973202\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/a1DA2Z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\"><strong>Edumodo</strong></a> is a powerful education WordPress theme that works with most LMS plugins like LearnPress, Tutor, LifterLMS, Sensei, and even LearnDash. The theme packs different prebuilt demos that specialize in any educational level and area. You can also customize the theme to your needs using the simple drag-n-drop technique, thanks to Elementor integration. In addition, it works with Gutenberg as well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What’s more? Edumodo comes with a responsive design and is compatible with WooCommerce to turn your education site into an online store. You can sell your book or other school materials. It uses <a href=\"https://toplistwp.com/10-best-wordpress-translate-plugins/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://toplistwp.com/10-best-wordpress-translate-plugins/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WordPress Translate Plugin</a> and RTL-support so international students can use their own language to read your website without any trouble. Social sharing and Instagram Feed are available to increase your followers too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Event Calendar support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Multiple course/ teacher style</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Course &amp; teacher page details style with page builder</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- weForm integration for course booking</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Apple TV effect</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Amazing mega menu</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Animation slider</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- MailChimp integration</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Fast support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-educavo\"><strong>Educavo</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":831155,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/educavo.jpg\" alt=\"educavo\" class=\"wp-image-831155\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://1.envato.market/rnWXAj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download</a> <a class=\"tp_button\" href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/educavo-education-wordpress-theme/full_screen_preview/28715006\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Demo</a>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/rnWXAj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\"><strong>Educavo</strong></a> is the best-selling WordPress theme in the education category. It\'s designed for selling online courses, schools, academies, training centers, education centers, workshops, kindergartens, and other educational institutions. 15 demos are available to test and choose from, installation is done with a click.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Educavo promises to look perfect on any device and screen size. In particular, you will find TutorLMS, LearnDash, and <strong>Learnpress Theme WordPress</strong> demos in the theme package. Furthermore, you have full control to modify and tailor any aspect of Educavo, using the Elementor integration with 120+ custom addons. You can find their video tutorials or documentation as well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Other features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 5 blog and single post page layouts</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 2 about page designs</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- 4 contact page layouts</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Unlimited color choices</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Revolution Slider support</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Redux framework</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Powerful theme options</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Off-canvas menu</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- SEO-friendly</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- Fast support team</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>- And so much more</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-final-thoughts\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hopefully, you enjoy reading our article today and find out the right theme for creating education website. These themes are powered by <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">LearnPress - #1 LMS plugin</a> so you can even save money for premium addons while building a powerful LMS system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/elearning-lms-wordpress-themes/\">8+ Best Education Elearning &amp; LMS WordPress Themes</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Typography', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '2466-2', '', '', '2022-02-01 07:34:10', '2022-02-01 07:34:10', '', 0, 'https://edupress.thimpress.com/lms/?p=2466', 0, 'post', '', 0),
