(3995, 1, '2023-11-08 01:33:23', '2023-11-08 01:33:23', 'icon search', 'icon search', 'icon search', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'icon-search-svg', '', '', '2023-11-08 01:33:23', '2023-11-08 01:33:23', '', 0, 'http://localhost/first-project/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/icon-search.svg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/svg+xml', 0),
(4087, 1, '2022-11-08 04:28:49', '2022-11-08 04:28:49', '<div><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you looking for the complete list of <strong><a href=\"https://thimpress.com/the-complete-list-of-learnpress-shortcodes/\">LearnPress Shortcodes</a></strong>?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LearnPress is the top #1 WordPress LMS plugin that you can quickly download on WordPress.org. It’s a great solution for creating, managing, and selling online courses with simple clicks. Of course, if you have LearnPress, you’ll have a chance to build online education, online school, and online course websites without coding knowledge. Also, <strong><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/G5Ook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Eduma</a> </strong>or <a href=\"https://1.envato.market/Xq2Ra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Coaching</strong></a> is a famous WordPress Education Theme that works perfectly with LearnPress. You can check it out if you plan to create an online education website, it will never disappoint you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can refer to our guide on <a href=\"https://toplistwp.com/how-to-install-wordpress-plugins-beginners-guide/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How To Install WordPress Plugins if you are a newbie</a> too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because of its famous platform, <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress/\"><strong>LearnPress</strong></a> also comes with numerous shortcodes to display functions related to the plugin or to add dynamic content to the WordPress editor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before going to share with you a full list of all LearnPress shortcodes, let’s take a quick view of what shortcodes are in WordPress and how you can use the theme effectively as well!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 id=\"h-what-are-wordpress-shortcodes-learnpress-shortcode\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are WordPress shortcodes? - LearnPress Shortcode</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WordPress shortcodes are similar to a shortcut that is written in 2 square brackets like <em>[shortcode]</em>. It’s used to add more features to your site. In addition, you can customize the shortcodes easily like the way you want since WordPress is an open-source platform. The advantage of these shortcuts is that to help you embed the things you need on your website without knowing the details about the underlying code.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":834280,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>', 'LearnPress Shortcodes', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'learnpress-shortcodes', '', '', '2022-11-08 04:28:49', '2022-11-08 04:28:49', '', 0, 'https://edupress.thimpress.com/?p=4087', 0, 'post', '', 0),
