eme that fits all WordPress projects, especially e-commerce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Flatsome stands as a perfect WordPress theme for online stores &amp; retailers. It contains all tools and widgets for stores &amp; freelancers to create and run websites including educational ones. Like all the themes in this collection, there shall be no coding knowledge required. Not using the standard WordPress post editor, Flatsome’s development team has built its WordPress page builder. Here, you can make grids, sliders, sidebars, and content sections in the same page builder. Besides, Flatsome lets you customize your site in real time with limitless options. Also, we can’t forget that Flatsome is always up-to-date with new features and bug fixing. In the latest version, Flatsome has delivered us a stacked product gallery layout, built-in additional variation images, and a theme status page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, you may find many other useful features such as WPML ready, SEO optimized, catalog mode, child theme included, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bridge – Creative LearnPress WordPress Theme</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":878268} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/bridge-creative-learnpress-wordpress-theme-e1673505854367.jpg\" alt=\"bridge creative learnpress wordpress theme\" class=\"wp-image-878268\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/MXDMjn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/bridge-creative-multipurpose-wordpress-theme/full_screen_preview/7315054\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From Qode, we present you&nbsp;<strong>Bridge</strong>&nbsp;– a responsive multi-concept WordPress theme. You may concern about who it can be used for. Thus, whether you run an online business, personal blog, or an LMS, Bridge should stay in your selection pocket.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In Bridge, you are free to select the page builder you want from these 3 options:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>WPBakery page builder</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Elementor page builder</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gutenberg page builder</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They are all fully compatible with Bridge and users can make use of them to create the most unique and outstanding websites in specific fields. Alongside the page builder selections, you will earn yourself 500+ premade web design demos. You can use every single one of them to build and decorate your website in just a niche of time with the 1-click demo importer. They range from travel, booking, retail, and spa, to fashion, cuisine, or education, meeting all of your demands in all fields, and as a matter of fact, very easy to import. Recently, it has just been updated with 24 more layout concepts from standard to innovative. Feel free to find the best solution for your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some other significant features of this LearnPress WordPress theme to notice are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Powerful and user-friendly interface</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Auto lifetime update</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Qode slider</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Fully customizable header/footer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mega/fullscreen menu</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Custom post/portfolio formats</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>And more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The7 – LearnPress WordPress Theme for Elementor &amp; WooCommerce</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":878278} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://thimpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/the7-learnpress-wordpress-theme-for-elementor-woocommerce-e1673507606740.jpg\" alt=\"the7 learnpress wordpress theme for elementor &amp; woocommerce\" class=\"wp-image-878278\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://1.envato.market/OR9MoP\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://preview.themeforest.net/item/the7-responsive-multipurpose-wordpress-theme/full_screen_preview/5556590\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Demo</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Offering a tremendous and powerful system to users,&nbsp;<strong>The7</strong>&nbsp;will deliver your site to higher milestones than you ever imagine. No matter who you are – a newcomer or an expert, The7 will always offer you the same features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There, the demo number of The7 is over 60 demo layouts and each of them is different and unique. To set up and modify them, it provides us Elementor, WPBakery page builder, Slider Revolution, and 1-click demo importer to make your site just in minutes. Moreover, you can create your headers, footers, page layouts, mega menus, search functions, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One special thing about The7 is that it lets visitors find the products they need fast and conveniently. Thanks to specific search widgets, The7 can help you reach that milestone. Besides, some other great features of this LearnPress WordPress theme are free lifetime updates, 24/7 support, SEO optimization, RTL-ready, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">LearnPress WordPress Theme: Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LearnPress is claimed as No.1 among the LMS plugins because of many reasons. Thus, one of them should be compatible with many famous and popular WordPress themes. The compatibilities will allow users more possibilities when making and running an LMS site. Therefore, you should have a LearnPress WordPress Theme for your education/coaching website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read more:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://thimpress.com/automating-with-learnpress-and-uncanny-automator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Automating Classroom with LearnPress and Uncanny Automator</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tags:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/blog/tag/certificates/\">Certificates</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/blog/tag/education/\">Education</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/blog/tag/instructor/\">Instructor</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/blog/tag/languages-school/\">Languages School</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/blog/tag/member/\">Member</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fedupress.thimpress.com%2Fblog%2Fonline-course-creation-secrets%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fedupress.thimpress.com%2Fblog%2Fonline-course-creation-secrets%2F&amp;description=Looking%20for%20an%20amazing%20%26amp%3B%20well-functional%20LearnPress%20WordPress%20Theme%3F%20Online%20education%20has%20become%20so%20popular%20that%20there%20are%20a%20lot...&amp;media=https%3A%2F%2Fedupress.thimpress.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2Fbest-learnpress-wordpress-theme-collection.png%20onclick=window.open(this.href);%20return%20false;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Fedupress.thimpress.com%2Fblog%2Fonline-course-creation-secrets%2F&amp;text=Best%20LearnPress%20WordPress%20Theme%20Collection%20for%202023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fedupress.thimpress.com%2Fblog%2Fonline-course-creation-secrets%2F&amp;title=Best%20LearnPress%20WordPress%20Theme%20Collection%20for%202023&amp;summary=&amp;source=Looking%20for%20an%20amazing%20%26amp%3B%20well-functional%20LearnPress%20WordPress%20Theme%3F%20Online%20education%20has%20become%20so%20popular%20that%20there%20are%20a%20lot...\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/blog/allow-edit-on-the-frontend/\">PrevPreviousAllow edit on the frontend</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No comments yet! You be the first to comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"reply-title\">Leave a Reply<small></small></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You must be&nbsp;<a href=\"https://edupress.thimpress.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fedupress.thimpress.com%2Fblog%2Fonline-course-creation-secrets%2F\">logged in</a>&nbsp;to post a comment.</p>\n<!